## Adapted redaction patterns

The credential-shaped redaction patterns in src/harness/report/data.mjs are
adapted from the legacy ai-harness project at commit
f5d5f84b9006b628778983dab56dd92dc8888156
(https://github.com/samartomar/ai-harness/tree/f5d5f84b9006b628778983dab56dd92dc8888156).
That project is Copyright 2026 The AI Harness (aih) authors and is licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0.
They were re-authored for portable structured-data projection without host or
environment access; they do not import the legacy engine or its collectors.

## Bundled certificate serialization libraries

The local package bundles PKI.js, ASN1.js and their serializer dependencies.
Their copyright notices and licenses are retained under the respective bundled
node_modules directories. PKI.js is BSD-3-Clause; ASN1.js is BSD-3-Clause.
These libraries encode certificates-only DER PKCS#7; they grant no OS trust
or native-client admission.

## Bundled sandbox runtime

The package includes the unmodified Anthropic Sandbox Runtime 0.0.78 and its
locked JavaScript dependencies. Their original license and copyright files remain
in their bundled node_modules directories. The runtime is Apache-2.0-licensed. The fixed
Harness integration does not grant native-client admission or general sandbox
configuration authority.
